OL,3,GNEWSACall for osteoporosis early
OL,4,Adiagnosis clinics
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from East Sussex who is living
OL,7,Fwith osteoporosis is campaigning to end
OL,8,Fwhat she calls a "deadly postcode
OL,9,Flottery" for NHS bone clinics.
OL,11,FCorinne Turnbull, from Hove, is among a
OL,12,Fgroup of campaigners travelling to the
OL,13,FLabour Party Conference in Liverpool on
OL,14,FSaturday to meet ministers and MPs.
OL,16,FThey are calling on the government to
OL,17,Fhonour a promise to roll out early
OL,18,Fdiagnosis clinics.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
